class PublicCloudLoadbalancerLoadbalancerNetworkRef(OVHModel):
    """
    Load balancer VIP network reference (desired)

    User-controlled declaration of the load balancer frontend network: the private
    network and subnet the virtual IP (VIP) port is created in, and therefore the
    network the listeners are reachable from. subnetId is mandatory. id is optional:
    when omitted, the network of the subnet is used, and when given, the subnet must
    belong to it.

    The optional IP refines how the VIP is addressed:
    * omitted - the fixed VIP address is assigned by IPAM inside the subnet.
    * an address inside the subnet CIDR - pins the fixed VIP address to that value.
    * an address outside the subnet CIDR - designates an EXISTING floating IP to
    associate with the VIP port. No address is ever allocated on your behalf.

    The VIP network is set at creation and is IMMUTABLE afterwards: it is not part of
    the update target spec, and neither the network, the subnet, nor the IP can be
    changed on a load balancer that already exists.
    """

    id: str | None = None
    """
    Network

    Identifier of the private network the VIP port is created in. This is the load
    balancer frontend network, from which its listeners are reachable. When omitted, the
    network of subnetId is used. Immutable after creation.
    """
    ip: str | None = None
    """
    IP address

    Address of the virtual IP, whose meaning depends on where it falls relative to the
    subnet CIDR. Inside the subnet CIDR: pins the fixed VIP address instead of letting
    IPAM assign it; the address must lie in the subnet allocation pool, must not be the
    subnet gateway address, and must not already be held by another port. Outside the
    subnet CIDR: designates an EXISTING floating IP of the project to associate with the
    VIP port - the floating IP is never created for you, must not already be associated
    with another port, and the subnet must be attached to a router with an external
    gateway. A public address requires the optional loadbalancer/usePublicIP IAM action.
    Left unset, the fixed VIP address is assigned by IPAM. Immutable after creation.
    """
    subnet_id: str = Field(alias="subnetId")
    """
    Subnet

    Identifier of the subnet the VIP port draws its fixed address from. When id is
    given, the subnet must belong to that network. Immutable after creation.
    """


